    "Eleven candidate nulls remain source-answerability misses: eight arise from an inherited empty artifact and three from verification rejection. An empty artifact explains availability but does not justify abstention against the original answerable source.",
    "Context/evidence availability and correct inferred views are not semantic answer correctness. Valid citation coordinates likewise do not prove the cited text supports an answer.",
    "The full historical evaluation stays at 233/320 useful answers with a failed unchanged numerical gate; this comparison neither changes that grade nor measures longitudinal work."
  ],
